    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BRITISH COMMONNE AL\nPALIFIC AIRLINES\nThe historic \"Southern Cross\" on the tarmac with one of BCPA's fleet of DC.6 airliners.",
      "BRITISH COMMONWEALTH\nPACIFIC\nAIRLINES LTD.\n4-\nPOST CARD\nADDRESS\nTHE HISTORIC \"SOUTHERN CROSS\"\nIn naming their route the \"Southern Cross\nRoute,\" BCA pay tribute to the famous\ntri-motored Fokker of this name in which\nthe courageous Sir Charles Kingsford-\nSmith and his gallant crew conquered the\nPacific by air.\nPRINTED IN AUSTRALIA\n2015.166.0367"
    ],
